  "goodToKnow": "Der Saum is a hem: den Saum kürzen (to take up the hem), or an edge or fringe: der Saum des Waldes. Säumen means to hem, and also to line: Tausende säumten die Straßen (thousands lined the streets). A separate old verb säumen meant to delay, giving säumig (late with payment) and der Säumniszuschlag (late fee). Plural: die Säume."
